&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Reikland Line Infantry are the professional career soldiers form Reikland province of the Empire, they are volunteery and very well discipline unit. These soldiers are the main units that Reikland provides to the Empirium, other provinces can also request or hire them from the governing body of Reikland.
